/src/**/temp/

# Deliberate test samples are source data, including log/temp-format fixtures
!**/fixtures/**/*.log
!**/fixtures/**/*.tmp
!**/fixtures/**/*.temp

# Local editor and operating-system state
.idea/
.vs/
.history/
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Do not broadly ignore *.lock, JSON, assets, fixtures or generated contracts.
